{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"16人のプリンシパルdeux大阪公演"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日目は研修旅行のため出れず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目の昼は北嶋を二幕で演じ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は栄に立候補して落ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして千秋楽。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼と夜いつみに立候補。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼に女中3として二幕に出演しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は残念ながら落ちてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目のミニライブから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングル新曲披露しましたー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは踊っててかなり楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売が楽しみだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にサプライズ発表びっくりした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の全国ツアー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しすぎるーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月19日（月）札幌　Zepp Sapporo\n8月23日（金）福岡　Zepp Fukuoka\n8月27日（火）大阪　Zepp Namba\n8月28日（水）名古屋Zepp Nagoya\n8月30日（金）東京　Zepp Tokyo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおおおおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しい夏になるぜ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/03/8976455/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからかなり長文になります><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京での15公演と大阪での5公演。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"計20公演。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"deuxをやると決まって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月にレッスンがすぐスタートして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年と違って本格的な舞台だと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らされて、分厚い台本もらって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セリフを全部覚えなきゃいけない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われて、無茶だと思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本格的な舞台を経験したことない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーがほとんどで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基礎稽古から始まり一ヶ月。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校からそのまま毎日稽古行って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休む暇もなくてそんな中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングル、二期生発表..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭パンクするかと思いました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、稽古は楽しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いのほか楽しくて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、なんか、ほんと楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥を捨てて大声を出す快感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰がどの役に立候補するかわからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が選ばれるかわからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戦わなきゃいけない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがすごい嫌だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも二幕の舞台に立ちたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷宮の花園のキャラクターは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも個性的で魅力的。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毒があるのにすごく愛らしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のイメージや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役のイメージにとらわれず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな役に挑戦したいと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれたとき嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手く演じられなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい反省した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれなかったとき悔しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何が足りなかったか考えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい反省した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん悔しい思いをして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん怒られて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局、最後まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納得のいく演技はできなかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度もリベンジした役も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝ち取ることができなかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、こうして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつの舞台をみんなで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作り上げることができて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当によかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルではなく、女優として。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演の間を挟んでの6th制作期間は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりしんどかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな頑張った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過酷な中でもそばには必ず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー、スタッフさんが居ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結束力が高まった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/03/8976455/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでやって来れたから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このメンバーとなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でも乗り越えられそうな気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の公演では28人だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心は33人でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて乃木メンだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観にきてくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3階席までタオルもばっちり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/03/8976455/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの声援を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古からずっとお世話になっていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ローズドエスパープル先生こと江本さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムーンシャドー先生こと柿丸さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生に舞台の楽しさを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーひとりひとりをちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとの言葉や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前呼ばれただけでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです！"